### Create Order

POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "C1001",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "P100",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 999.00
    },
    {
      "productId": "P200",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 499.00
    }
  ]
}

### Get Order
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders/ORD-123
### orders belonging to that customer.
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders?customerId=C1001